         <a:documentation xmlns:a="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0">(Gameplay Mode) A distinct configuration of the platform edition’s mechanics and gameplay in the gameplay footageNote that Default and Normal / moderate are separate options. Select Default if only one gameplay mode is available or the default gameplay mode does not have a unique name or identifier. Select Normal / moderate if that gameplay mode was selected among other options, such as Hard / expert and Easy / beginner / casual.Controlled vocabulary adapted, with minor changes, from Wikipedia, "Glossary of Video Game Terms," 2026</a:documentation>
