         <a:documentation xmlns:a="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0">(Narrative Subgenre) Patterns of storytelling in the gameplay footage based on how the platform edition tells, plots, and arranges storiesUse abstract / no narrative for abstract games and games without narratives or narrative elements.Controlled vocabulary adapted, with additions, from Lee et al., Controlled Vocabulary for Narrative Genre, 2024 and Wikipedia, "List of Genres," 2026.</a:documentation>
