   <define name="transportMode">
      <element name="transportMode">
         <a:documentation xmlns:a="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0">(Means of Transport) A means of conveyance or travel from one place to another appearing in the gameplay footageSelect No means of transport if the footage contains no means of conveyance or travel.Controlled vocabulary (adapted, with changes and additions, from Poff and Atari 2025 and Lee et al., Controlled Vocabulary for Setting, 2024.</a:documentation>
