   <define name="theme">
      <element name="theme">
         <a:documentation xmlns:a="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0">(Theme) A common thread, motif, subject, or idea that recurs in the gameplay footage (Getty 2004; Lee et al., VGMS 4.2, 2024)This element will typically be repeated.The controlled vocabulary for this element avoids duplicating options included in the controlled vocabularies for the Atmosphere and Experience elements.Use the Gameplay Footage Note to further describe the theme(s).Controlled vocabulary adapted, with additions, from Lee et al., Controlled Vocabulary for Theme, 2024.</a:documentation>
