   <define name="experience">
      <element name="experience">
         <a:documentation xmlns:a="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0">(Experience) An emotion, feeling, or range of emotions and feelings experienced by the player when the gameplay footage was recordedThe person responsible for the gameplay (see Gameplay Attribution) should complete this element.The controlled vocabulary for this element avoids duplicating options included in the controlled vocabularies for the Atmosphere and Theme elements.Use the Gameplay Footage Note to further describe the experience(s).Controlled vocabulary informed by Isbister 2016 and Anable 2018.</a:documentation>
